<p>Teleport all foes in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 5, 6, 7, 9</acronym> to your boneyard, as close to its center as possible.</p><p>Up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym> ghouls or skeletons are created around them by the boneyard, without any additional soul cost, but they only last 5 turns.</p><p></p>